bun for Debian and Ubuntu
=========================

This package contains upstream's release binary, unchanged, as /usr/bin/bun.
It isn't built from source. The checksums of the release files are pinned in
freshdeb, and the build checks that the binary reports the release's commit.

Update with apt. "bun upgrade" isn't disabled: as root, with unzip installed, it
replaces /usr/bin/bun with a binary from GitHub behind dpkg's back, and the next
package update overwrites that again. Without unzip it stops with an error.

Packages installed with "bun install -g" go to ~/.bun, not to /usr.
